<title>USA: Sunrise Bancorp holders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Sunrise Bancorp holders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEVILLE, Calif. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunrise Bancorp said Tuesday that the holders of a majority of outstanding shares of the company approved its proposed merger with First Banks America Inc's Sunlight Holdings Inc for $4 per share.</p>
<p>Sunrise said it expected the merger to be completed at the end of October.</p>
</text>
